<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australian Treasurer to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australian Treasurer to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello will hold a news conference at 12.00 pm (0100 GMT) today, his office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Costello would comment on September quarter GDP figures due out at 11.30 a.m. (0030 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Canberra Bureau 61-6 273-2730</p>
</text>
